# Intentionally empty. This file is a leftover from the standalone QNDF
# repository, and git only reads .gitmodules at the root of a working tree, so
# the declaration it used to hold registered nothing: `git clone
# --recurse-submodules` never fetched ssp_remesh/libigl, and building ssp_remesh
# failed on a missing igl::core.
#
# The submodule is now declared at the repository root, in ../../../.gitmodules,
# pinned at libigl v2.3.0. Add new submodules there, not here.
